        "An Extended Essay question has to stay answerable with sources the student can genuinely reach before January.",
        "Coaching stays on one side of a clear line: pointing out gaps, never producing the passage itself.",
        "Full timed practice under real conditions replaces topic review once internal deadlines are behind a student.",
